["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/hasRoleIn", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The `from` Element has a role in the `to` Element. The use of the hasRoleIn is constrained to `RoleRelationship` classed relationships.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
